# Whitelist approach — C:\Test is historically a git repo for the
# youtube_downloader project, but this directory is also used as a
# workspace for many unrelated projects. To prevent accidental
# commits of unrelated work, we ignore everything by default and
# explicitly whitelist the youtube_downloader tree.
#
# Any NEW project added under C:\Test\ should have its own .git
# (run `git init` inside the subfolder before making changes).

# Ignore everything at the root by default.
/*

# Whitelist: this .gitignore file itself and the youtube_downloader tree.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/youtube_downloader/
!/youtube_downloader_v2/
